    "title": "Severe Thunderstorm Warning by NWS - NewsBreak",
    "text": "Check NWS updates here The storm which prompted the warning has moved out of the area. Therefore, the warning will be allowed to expire. However, gusty winds and heavy rain are still possible with this thunderstorm. Remember, a new Severe Thunderstorm Warning is in effect until 115 AM for Danville, southern Pittsylvania County, Caswell County and eastern Rockingham County.",
